1
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:15,473
<i>Jaialdirako prestatzen
hainbeste denbora pasa genuen</i>

2
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:18,767
<i>eta konturatu orduko, amaitu egin zen.</i>

3
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:20,894
Alfonbra etxera eraman zenuen?

4
00:00:20,895 --> 00:00:22,730
Ezin dut, motel.

5
00:00:22,731 --> 00:00:24,691
<i>- Eta biharamunean...</i>
- Zer pena.

6
00:00:29,279 --> 00:00:32,699
{\an8}MOMOKA - GAUR
ASPALDIKO

7
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,702
Barkatu, bat-batean idatzi dizut.

8
00:00:36,369 --> 00:00:38,705
Zurekin hitz egin nahi nuen, Koyun.

9
00:00:40,957 --> 00:00:42,459
Bai, nik ere bai.

10
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,296
Hasi zu.

11
00:00:47,547 --> 00:00:49,548
Garbi esango dizut.

12
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:52,093
Urrundu zaitez Minatorengandik.

13
00:02:26,604 --> 00:02:30,942
21. ATALA: GAIZKI-ULERTUAK

14
00:02:32,610 --> 00:02:36,447
<i>Beti jakin izan dut
kontraesan hutsa naizela.</i>

15
00:02:37,615 --> 00:02:40,409
<i>Ez dela mehatxu bat
esaten diot neure buruari,</i>

16
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:43,705
<i>eta halere
bere presentzia jasanezina zait.</i>

17
00:02:44,789 --> 00:02:46,332
<i>Koyun gorroto dut.</i>

18
00:02:47,375 --> 00:02:49,836
<i>Hainbat aldiz galdetu nion.</i>

19
00:02:50,712 --> 00:02:52,838
<i>Minato gogoko bazuen,</i>

20
00:02:52,839 --> 00:02:55,091
<i>gogor heldu behar zion.</i>

21
00:02:56,301 --> 00:02:59,303
<i>Itsusia da orain
Minatoren lagun min egitea.</i>

22
00:02:59,304 --> 00:03:00,763
<i>- Maltzurkeria...</i>
- Bale.

23
00:03:02,307 --> 00:03:04,017
{\an8}Harengandik urrunduko naiz.

24
00:03:05,643 --> 00:03:10,398
<i>Ez zaizu gustatzen
talde osoa elkartzen garenean, ez?</i>

25
00:03:11,232 --> 00:03:14,736
Edo Amamiyarekin
lotura guztiak moztea nahi duzu?

26
00:03:15,695 --> 00:03:17,488
Bueno,

27
00:03:18,156 --> 00:03:21,617
gela berean gaude
eta noizbait hitz egin beharko dugu.

28
00:03:21,618 --> 00:03:23,286
Ez da erraza izango,

29
00:03:24,037 --> 00:03:26,330
ez baitut zakarra izan nahi.

30
00:03:26,331 --> 00:03:31,461
Baina hori Amamiyak eta zuk
nola ikusten duzuen araberakoa da.

31
00:03:32,086 --> 00:03:34,338
<i>Minatok nola ikusten duen arabera?</i>

32
00:03:34,339 --> 00:03:39,260
<i>Ziur zaudelako zu hautatuko zaituela?</i>

33
00:03:39,969 --> 00:03:41,095
<i>Zer du neska honek?</i>

34
00:03:41,596 --> 00:03:43,765
<i>Hainbesterako ez balitz bezala
jokatzen ari da.</i>

35
00:03:44,974 --> 00:03:46,517
<i>Bere neska-laguna naiz.</i>

36
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,770
<i>Eta traba egiten diot.</i>

37
00:03:50,813 --> 00:03:53,775
Benetan? Ziur ondo iruditzen zaizula?

38
00:03:54,943 --> 00:03:57,695
Badakit beti ukatu duzula,

39
00:03:58,529 --> 00:04:00,281
baina Minato gogoko duzu, ez?

40
00:04:01,699 --> 00:04:06,246
Nire sentimenduek
ez dute eraginik zuen harremanean.

41
00:04:07,038 --> 00:04:08,790
Zurekin dabil.

42
00:04:09,499 --> 00:04:11,084
Zu hautatu zaitu.

43
00:04:12,877 --> 00:04:16,005
Barkatu horrela sentiarazi zaituen
zerbait egin badut,

44
00:04:16,589 --> 00:04:21,051
{\an8}baina elkarrekin zaudetenetik,

45
00:04:21,052 --> 00:04:24,806
{\an8}Amamiyak lagun gisa baino ez nau tratatu.

46
00:04:25,473 --> 00:04:28,559
Zurekin benetan egon nahi du, nik uste.

47
00:04:29,769 --> 00:04:33,147
<i>Amamiya eta biok lagunak baino ez gara.</i>

48
00:04:34,315 --> 00:04:36,733
Baina halere ez bazara fidatzen,

49
00:04:36,734 --> 00:04:40,154
harengandik urrunduko naiz zuk esan arte.

50
00:04:41,614 --> 00:04:44,784
{\an8}Baina fida zaitez Amamiyarengan.

51
00:04:47,161 --> 00:04:48,663
<i>Zergatik?</i>

52
00:04:49,205 --> 00:04:52,541
{\an8}Ea gogoko zenuen galdetu dizut
eta ez duzu ukatu.

53
00:04:52,542 --> 00:04:54,001
{\an8}Horrek erantzuten du.

54
00:04:54,002 --> 00:04:56,336
ERAKUTSI ZERBAIT, EDOZER
EZ ZAUDE ADOS

55
00:04:56,337 --> 00:04:58,755
<i>Zergatik jasotzen dut nik errieta?</i>

56
00:04:58,756 --> 00:05:00,132
SANTUJALE HALAKOA

57
00:05:00,133 --> 00:05:01,216
TEORIAK ASMATZEN

58
00:05:01,217 --> 00:05:04,345
<i>Badirudi neu naizela erruduna.</i>

59
00:05:06,264 --> 00:05:08,891
<i>Baina gauzak argi uztera etorri naiz.</i>

60
00:05:11,311 --> 00:05:14,313
Pozte nau ondo ulertzeak.

61
00:05:14,314 --> 00:05:17,567
Gogoko duzun mutilari
uko egiteko prest zaude neska duelako.

62
00:05:18,151 --> 00:05:20,319
Hau da, bai, elkarrekin gaude,

63
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:24,907
baina ez gara ezkontzekoak,
ez dugu ezer sinatu. Ahozko akordioa da.

64
00:05:25,408 --> 00:05:26,491
BERE BIKOTEKIDEA NAIZ

65
00:05:26,492 --> 00:05:30,246
<i>Elkarrekin zaudetenean
gaizki pasatzen dut.</i>

66
00:05:30,913 --> 00:05:32,998
Izan ere, ni zu banintz,

67
00:05:32,999 --> 00:05:36,085
saiatzen jarraituko nuke
neska-laguna eduki arren.

68
00:05:36,669 --> 00:05:37,836
HORREK KEZKATZEN NAU

69
00:05:37,837 --> 00:05:40,590
<i>Nik ez nuke hain erraz amore emango.</i>

70
00:05:41,799 --> 00:05:45,177
<i>Ez dut nahi hain neska epel batek...</i>

71
00:05:45,178 --> 00:05:46,970
ZALANTZARIK GABE

72
00:05:46,971 --> 00:05:48,055
NIK GEHIAGO MAITE DUT

73
00:05:48,056 --> 00:05:49,599
<i>...Amamiya kendu iezadan.</i>

74
00:05:54,896 --> 00:05:56,647
Nola "saiatzen jarraitu"?

75
00:05:57,982 --> 00:06:01,235
Gauzak diren bezala dira
egindako ahaleginengatik.

76
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:06,448
Baina saiatzen jarraitzea
beste pertsona bat gogoko dutenean,

77
00:06:06,449 --> 00:06:07,867
egoista samarra da, ez?

78
00:06:08,826 --> 00:06:13,163
Benetan diotsut: nik ez dizkiot
nire sentimenduak inposatuko.

79
00:06:13,164 --> 00:06:17,377
<i>Besteak zure aurretik jartzen
jarraitzen badituzu, gaizki joango zaizu.</i>

80
00:06:18,002 --> 00:06:19,003
Bueno,

81
00:06:19,587 --> 00:06:22,006
berdin dio nik zer uste dudan.

82
00:06:23,299 --> 00:06:27,136
Elkar ulertu beharrik ere ez dago.

83
00:06:28,221 --> 00:06:29,554
<i>Etsaitasuna.</i>

84
00:06:29,555 --> 00:06:34,559
{\an8}Zu besteekin harremanetan hasten zara
batere zalantzarik gabe.

85
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:38,355
{\an8}Zure helburuak lortzeko
sozializatzen duzu.

86
00:06:38,356 --> 00:06:40,565
{\an8}Zeure buruaz oso seguru zaude.

87
00:06:40,566 --> 00:06:42,734
<i>Maltzurkeriarekin esan du.</i>

88
00:06:42,735 --> 00:06:44,194
<i>Agiraka ari zait?</i>

89
00:06:44,195 --> 00:06:45,905
Benetan esaten dizut,

90
00:06:46,781 --> 00:06:48,908
{\an8}inbidia izan dizut beti.

91
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:52,160
- Zer?
- Ekimen handikoa zara.

92
00:06:52,161 --> 00:06:53,745
Erabakiak hartzen dituzu.

93
00:06:53,746 --> 00:06:58,418
Zeure buruarekiko konfiantza handia duzu.
Erabat kontrakoak gara.

94
00:06:59,502 --> 00:07:02,629
{\an8}Inbidia izan dizut beti, Momoka.

95
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:05,508
{\an8}Inbidia didazula?

96
00:07:06,008 --> 00:07:08,302
Inbidia dizut, benetan,

97
00:07:09,011 --> 00:07:12,223
baina halere,
ezinezkoa zait zu bezala jokatzea.

98
00:07:13,057 --> 00:07:14,599
Zergatik?

99
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:17,186
Jendearekin sozializatzean,

100
00:07:18,312 --> 00:07:20,313
{\an8}muga garbia ezartzen duzu

101
00:07:20,314 --> 00:07:23,109
{\an8}ezagutu nahi duzun jendea
eta berdin dizutenen artean.

102
00:07:24,026 --> 00:07:25,570
Bai, egia da.

103
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:29,240
Nekagarria da
mundu guztia modu berean tratatzea.

104
00:07:30,908 --> 00:07:32,743
Bai, hori ulertzen dut.

105
00:07:33,453 --> 00:07:34,579
Baina...

106
00:07:35,621 --> 00:07:40,084
Azkenaldian
Momoka zurekin asko ibili da, ez?

107
00:07:40,793 --> 00:07:42,879
Lehen nirekin ibiltzen zen.

108
00:07:43,713 --> 00:07:46,424
Eta badakizu zergatik den, ezta?

109
00:07:48,009 --> 00:07:50,094
{\an8}Ezin duzu jendea
zure probetxurako erabili.

110
00:07:50,761 --> 00:07:53,222
{\an8}Txotxongiloak bagina bezala.

111
00:07:53,973 --> 00:07:55,600
{\an8}Nondik atera duzu hori?

112
00:07:56,267 --> 00:08:00,062
{\an8}Zer egin dut ba
zuk horrelakorik pentsatzeko?

113
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:02,314
{\an8}Ezer ez.

114
00:08:02,315 --> 00:08:04,400
{\an8}Ez duzu nigatik ezer sentitu behar.

115
00:08:05,610 --> 00:08:10,865
<i>Baina berdin dizuten pertsona horiek,
txotxongiloak bezala tratatzen dituzunak,</i>

116
00:08:11,657 --> 00:08:15,495
<i>badituzte beren kezkak
eta sufritu dezakete,</i>

117
00:08:16,204 --> 00:08:17,914
<i>haiek ere gizakiak baitira.</i>

118
00:08:19,290 --> 00:08:24,253
Zu ezkutatzen saiatu arren,
erabiltzen dituzula konturatzen dira.

119
00:08:24,754 --> 00:08:26,005
Gaizki pasatzen dute.

120
00:08:26,756 --> 00:08:30,218
{\an8}Gauza bat da axola ez izatea, beste bat
jendea zure nahierara erabiltzea.

121
00:08:30,843 --> 00:08:32,261
{\an8}Hori da

122
00:08:33,471 --> 00:08:35,389
{\an8}nik esan nahi nizuna.

123
00:08:42,855 --> 00:08:46,608
Ene, benetan gorroto nauzu, e?

124
00:08:46,609 --> 00:08:50,111
Baina ohituta nago neskei ez gustatzera.

125
00:08:50,112 --> 00:08:51,239
Ez.

126
00:08:51,864 --> 00:08:54,367
Nik ez zaitut gorroto.

127
00:08:54,867 --> 00:09:00,206
Apenas ezagutzen zaitut,
nola gorrotoko zaitut ba?

128
00:09:01,123 --> 00:09:02,458
Berdina esaten dizut.

129
00:09:03,501 --> 00:09:09,006
Baina egiten dituzun gauza batzuk
ez zaizkit ondo iruditzen.

130
00:09:10,383 --> 00:09:12,802
Ba milesker informazioarengatik.

131
00:09:13,386 --> 00:09:19,308
Baina guk bakarrik joka dezakegu
geure zoriontasunaren alde, ezta?

132
00:09:19,892 --> 00:09:22,519
Mundu guztia ondo tratatu behar dugu.

133
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:25,272
Besteekin zuhurrak izan behar dugu.

134
00:09:25,273 --> 00:09:27,942
Baina niri ezinezkoa zait hori egitea.

135
00:09:29,777 --> 00:09:31,112
Egoista naizelako.

136
00:09:33,906 --> 00:09:35,950
{\an8}Niri ere ezinezkoa zait.

137
00:09:36,534 --> 00:09:40,705
Baina soilik
zure interesen alde jokatuz gero,

138
00:09:41,455 --> 00:09:44,083
falta zaizkizun gauzetan
jarriko duzu arreta.

139
00:09:45,001 --> 00:09:47,503
Eta zorigaiztokoa izango zara.

140
00:09:50,006 --> 00:09:52,800
Zuri buruz ari zara?

141
00:09:53,301 --> 00:09:55,136
Edo nigatik esan duzu?

142
00:09:56,304 --> 00:09:57,679
{\an8}Biak.

143
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,349
{\an8}Horrexegatik nahi dut Amamiya eta zu

144
00:10:00,850 --> 00:10:03,686
{\an8}zuen harremanean zoriontsu izatea.

145
00:10:05,605 --> 00:10:08,691
{\an8}Beraz, distantziak gordeko ditut.

146
00:10:09,692 --> 00:10:10,943
Ondo iruditzen zaizu?

147
00:10:13,613 --> 00:10:14,614
{\an8}Bai.

148
00:10:18,242 --> 00:10:19,744
<i>Gorroto dut.</i>

149
00:10:21,245 --> 00:10:25,624
<i>Gorroto dut eta egiten duen guztiak,
bere existentzia berak,</i>

150
00:10:25,625 --> 00:10:27,877
<i>kristoren amorrua ematen didate.</i>

151
00:10:29,545 --> 00:10:36,010
<i>Nahiago nuke
berak ere gorroto nauela esango balu.</i>

152
00:10:37,011 --> 00:10:41,349
<i>Nire etsaia balitz,
nire buruan aurre egingo nioke.</i>

153
00:10:42,391 --> 00:10:44,226
<i>Eta neure burua zurituko nuke.</i>

154
00:10:45,853 --> 00:10:47,688
<i>Nahi dudana lortu dut,</i>

155
00:10:48,689 --> 00:10:50,816
<i>zergatik sentitzen naiz hain hutsik?</i>

156
00:10:53,611 --> 00:10:55,237
Eta tematuta nengoen.

157
00:10:56,489 --> 00:10:58,574
Orduan, Hayatok esan zidan...

158
00:10:59,325 --> 00:11:01,243
KOPETILUN

159
00:11:02,036 --> 00:11:03,037
Momoka?

160
00:11:06,082 --> 00:11:07,083
Zer duzu?

161
00:11:12,004 --> 00:11:13,255
Minato.

162
00:11:14,048 --> 00:11:15,341
Aizu, gogoko nauzu?

163
00:11:18,678 --> 00:11:20,178
{\an8}Bai, gogoko zaitut.

164
00:11:20,179 --> 00:11:21,222
{\an8}Zer gogoko duzu?

165
00:11:22,348 --> 00:11:25,183
{\an8}Zeure buruaz ziur zaudela,
nekaezina zarela, argia.

166
00:11:25,184 --> 00:11:30,980
Konplimendu anbiguoak dira, ez?
Kalkulatzailea naizela uste duzula dirudi.

167
00:11:30,981 --> 00:11:31,982
{\an8}HALA NAIZ, BAINA...

168
00:11:33,484 --> 00:11:34,819
Ona da zuhurra izatea.

169
00:11:36,696 --> 00:11:37,697
Aizu...

170
00:11:38,239 --> 00:11:40,783
Nor gustatzen zaizu gehiago? Koyun ala ni?

171
00:11:41,575 --> 00:11:43,953
{\an8}Eta galdera hori? Koyun nire laguna da.

172
00:11:44,745 --> 00:11:48,416
Miki edo Yota bezalakoa.
Beste modu batean gustatzen zait.

173
00:11:48,999 --> 00:11:52,837
{\an8}Eta Koyunek gogoko zaituela esaten badizu?

174
00:11:53,504 --> 00:11:56,589
{\an8}Bera aukeratuko zenuke, ezta?

175
00:11:56,590 --> 00:11:58,174
{\an8}Ez.

176
00:11:58,175 --> 00:12:00,052
{\an8}Zurekin nabilelako.

177
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:06,058
<i>Horregatik bakarrik?</i>

178
00:12:06,934 --> 00:12:09,061
<i>Zer ari naiz gaizki egiten?</i>

179
00:12:09,854 --> 00:12:15,358
<i>Gauzak ondo egiten ari naizela uste dut,
baina beti berdina gertatzen zait.</i>

180
00:12:15,359 --> 00:12:16,569
NOSKI, AURRERA
LASAI

181
00:12:17,194 --> 00:12:18,863
<i>Oraindik kezkatuta dago?</i>

182
00:12:20,156 --> 00:12:24,201
Barkatu kezkarazi bazaitut.
Zer egin dezaket konpontzeko?

183
00:12:24,994 --> 00:12:27,413
Esan, zer nahi duzu egitea?

184
00:12:29,123 --> 00:12:31,709
Mesedez, ez izan hain logikoa!

185
00:12:32,293 --> 00:12:35,588
Sentimenduak ez dira logikoak!
Zuk zer sentimendu lehenesten duzu?

186
00:12:39,425 --> 00:12:42,261
Entzun, Koyungandik aldentzea nahi dut.

187
00:12:42,762 --> 00:12:46,222
Lagunak baino ez zaretela diozu,
baina intimoegiak zarete.

188
00:12:46,223 --> 00:12:48,559
Amorrua ematen dit hain ondo eramateak!

189
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:53,481
Ondo da.

190
00:12:55,065 --> 00:12:57,443
Baina zenbat aldendu behar naiz?

191
00:12:58,277 --> 00:13:01,280
Ez duzu nahi berarekin geratzea, ez?

192
00:13:01,822 --> 00:13:04,574
Edo harremana erabat mozteaz ari zara?

193
00:13:04,575 --> 00:13:08,286
{\an8}Gela berean gaude
eta hitz egin beharko dugu,

194
00:13:08,287 --> 00:13:10,038
{\an8}ez da erraza izango.

195
00:13:10,039 --> 00:13:12,249
{\an8}DÉJÀ VU...

196
00:13:13,292 --> 00:13:15,251
Ai ama!

197
00:13:15,252 --> 00:13:17,755
- Hau amorrua!
- Zer duzu?

198
00:13:23,719 --> 00:13:25,720
Aitak ez duela afalduko dio.

199
00:13:25,721 --> 00:13:27,556
Lehenago esatea ere bazuen.

200
00:13:28,933 --> 00:13:31,644
Minato, zuk jango duzu?

201
00:13:38,984 --> 00:13:40,277
Ezin dut guztia jan.

202
00:13:41,529 --> 00:13:43,781
Normalean dena irensten duzu.

203
00:13:44,824 --> 00:13:47,660
<i>Zerbait gertatzen zait...</i>

204
00:13:53,332 --> 00:13:54,416
<i>Ezin dut lo egin.</i>

205
00:13:57,461 --> 00:14:00,214
<i>Neska-laguna izatea ez da erraza.</i>

206
00:14:02,091 --> 00:14:04,467
{\an8}<i>Zuk zer sentimendu lehenesten duzu?</i>

207
00:14:04,468 --> 00:14:07,220
<i>Eskerrik asko nire laguna izateagatik.</i>

208
00:14:07,221 --> 00:14:09,889
{\an8}<i>Ea egunen batean maitemintzen zaren...</i>

209
00:14:09,890 --> 00:14:14,436
<i>- Ba maiteminduta ikusi nahi zintuzket.
- Zuk zer sentitzen duzu?</i>

210
00:14:23,821 --> 00:14:26,907
<i>Nola hartuko dut lo orain?</i>

211
00:14:29,994 --> 00:14:31,077
LEHER EGINDA

212
00:14:31,078 --> 00:14:33,247
<i>Ez dut batere lo egin.</i>

213
00:14:33,831 --> 00:14:37,293
Minato. Azkenaldian
hortzak karraskatzen dituzu gauean.

214
00:14:38,002 --> 00:14:40,670
Estresatuta zabiltza?

215
00:14:40,671 --> 00:14:41,672
Ni?

216
00:14:43,299 --> 00:14:46,009
Ez, noski. Zu oso lasaia zara eta.

217
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:47,177
Bai.

218
00:14:47,928 --> 00:14:51,682
<i>Egia esan, azkenaldian
apur bat arraro sentitzen naiz.</i>

219
00:14:52,349 --> 00:14:54,435
<i>Eta burua bueltaka daukat.</i>

220
00:14:56,270 --> 00:14:58,229
{\an8}Ai...

221
00:14:58,230 --> 00:15:00,523
{\an8}- Zer duzu?
- Ezin dut...

222
00:15:00,524 --> 00:15:02,275
Minato?

223
00:15:02,276 --> 00:15:03,819
Ai, mina...

224
00:15:05,779 --> 00:15:07,322
Ondo zaude, Minato?

225
00:15:07,323 --> 00:15:08,699
Ai ama!

226
00:15:09,742 --> 00:15:11,076
{\an8}Estres kontua da.

227
00:15:12,036 --> 00:15:13,411
{\an8}Estresa?

228
00:15:13,412 --> 00:15:16,874
Bai, pertsonaren arabera
modu ezberdinetan agertzen da.

229
00:15:17,416 --> 00:15:22,630
Batzuetan poliki-poliki handiagotzen da
eta apenas konturatzen zara.

230
00:15:24,006 --> 00:15:29,719
Kontua da burua nekatuta duzula, gazte.
Ea zer moduz errezetatuko dizudanarekin.

231
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:34,474
Klinika psikosomatiko batera
joan behar zenuke onera egin ezean.

232
00:15:34,475 --> 00:15:36,143
<i>Klinika psikosomatikoa?</i>

233
00:15:36,769 --> 00:15:39,687
{\an8}Eskerrak arratsaldera arte
ez dudala klaserik.

234
00:15:39,688 --> 00:15:41,023
{\an8}Bai.

235
00:15:41,607 --> 00:15:44,526
Zeure burua zaindu behar duzu, Minato.

236
00:15:45,027 --> 00:15:46,028
Bai.

237
00:15:47,363 --> 00:15:49,615
<i>Estresatuta? Baina zergatik?</i>

238
00:15:50,616 --> 00:15:53,535
Ui, enbragea kentzea ahaztu zait.

239
00:15:59,416 --> 00:16:03,045
{\an8}Etxera iritsi gara,
baina aparkatu behar dut. Animo!

240
00:16:03,671 --> 00:16:05,965
Minato, zu zoaz barrura.

241
00:16:06,548 --> 00:16:07,549
Bale.

242
00:16:11,011 --> 00:16:13,180
{\an8}<i>Zer? Atea ez dago giltzaz itxita?</i>

243
00:16:13,806 --> 00:16:14,932
<i>Bai bitxia.</i>

244
00:16:16,225 --> 00:16:17,393
{\an8}- Zer?
- Ui!

245
00:16:19,979 --> 00:16:21,772
A, zu zara, Minato!

246
00:16:23,065 --> 00:16:24,441
{\an8}Kaito!

247
00:16:28,529 --> 00:16:33,492
- Barkatu, izutu zaitut?
- Ez sartu etxean lapur bat bazina bezala.

248
00:16:34,076 --> 00:16:36,369
Aizu, hau ere nire etxea zen.

249
00:16:36,370 --> 00:16:40,915
Bueno, ikusi zaitudanean "Ui" esan duzu.

250
00:16:40,916 --> 00:16:42,543
{\an8}Bai, tira...

251
00:16:43,419 --> 00:16:46,462
{\an8}- Zigiluaren bila etorri naiz.
- Lapur halakoa!

252
00:16:46,463 --> 00:16:49,800
Hemen bizi nintzenean hau erabiltzen nuen
nire kontu korrontea irekitzeko.

253
00:16:50,843 --> 00:16:52,260
Nik paso.

254
00:16:52,261 --> 00:16:55,680
Banoa fakultatera. Egizu nahi duzuna.

255
00:16:55,681 --> 00:16:56,889
{\an8}Aio.

256
00:16:56,890 --> 00:17:01,394
{\an8}A! Minato ez dago oso ondo,
ez iezaiozu gehiegi gogaitu, aditu?

257
00:17:01,395 --> 00:17:03,312
Zer? Gaixorik dago?

258
00:17:03,313 --> 00:17:05,024
Medikutik itzuli berri gara.

259
00:17:05,566 --> 00:17:07,900
Lasai, orain hobeto nago.

260
00:17:07,901 --> 00:17:08,902
{\an8}Agur.

261
00:17:12,281 --> 00:17:13,824
{\an8}- Gero arte.
- Bai.

262
00:17:16,535 --> 00:17:19,788
- Ez zarete liskartu, arraroa da.
- Heldua naiz ja.

263
00:17:20,914 --> 00:17:23,541
{\an8}Minato, gaixorik zaude ala?

264
00:17:23,542 --> 00:17:25,835
Ez, lasai.

265
00:17:25,836 --> 00:17:28,672
Nekatuta nago, besterik ez.

266
00:17:29,465 --> 00:17:32,759
{\an8}Medikuak gehiegi ez estresatzeko esan dit.

267
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:34,678
{\an8}Hara...

268
00:17:35,512 --> 00:17:39,266
Bueno, normala da estresaturik egotea
zure izateko moduarekin.

269
00:17:40,601 --> 00:17:41,602
Entzun, Minato.

270
00:17:42,603 --> 00:17:46,857
{\an8}Amain emateko joera duzu
eta zure sentimenduak gordetzen dituzu.

271
00:17:47,483 --> 00:17:51,987
{\an8}Pentsatzen duzuna erreprimitu
eta barruan pilatzen zaizu dena.

272
00:17:52,571 --> 00:17:55,157
{\an8}- Beti izan zara horrelakoa.
- Ziur aski ez...

273
00:17:55,783 --> 00:17:56,784
Barkatu.

274
00:17:57,409 --> 00:18:02,247
Nire errua da, aita eta amarekin
beti liskarrean nenbilelako.

275
00:18:02,748 --> 00:18:04,833
Egin behar ez zenaren etsenplua nintzen.

276
00:18:05,584 --> 00:18:09,128
<i>Errieta egiten zidaten
gogoko nuena egiten nuelako,</i>

277
00:18:09,129 --> 00:18:10,839
<i>eta begira nola atera zaren.</i>

278
00:18:11,965 --> 00:18:15,094
<i>Zu zinen
etxean nire alde egiten zuen bakarra.</i>

279
00:18:15,677 --> 00:18:17,513
Estu hartuta zeunden.

280
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:22,601
Nire errua izan zen
eta barkamena eskatzen dizut.

281
00:18:23,811 --> 00:18:25,395
{\an8}Zer haizek jo zaitu?

282
00:18:26,814 --> 00:18:30,067
{\an8}Sekula ez zara ona izan jendea irakurtzen.

283
00:18:30,567 --> 00:18:31,610
{\an8}Barkatu?

284
00:18:32,319 --> 00:18:36,697
{\an8}Estresarengatik lana utzi behar izan duten
lagun pare bat daukat.

285
00:18:36,698 --> 00:18:38,450
Gehiegi jasan dutelako.

286
00:18:39,243 --> 00:18:42,371
Bat-batean eztanda egiten dute
eta pikutara dena.

287
00:18:42,996 --> 00:18:44,623
{\an8}Ez dut nahi zuri hori gertatzea.

288
00:18:45,916 --> 00:18:48,127
Asko falta zait lanean hasteko.

289
00:18:49,253 --> 00:18:50,254
{\an8}Arrazoi duzu.

290
00:18:50,838 --> 00:18:55,509
Helduok
inguruan dugunaz ohartu behar gara.

291
00:18:56,218 --> 00:18:58,469
Baina, jende multzo handi batean,

292
00:18:58,470 --> 00:19:01,849
denok ezin dugu
gai bati buruz berdin pentsatu.

293
00:19:02,808 --> 00:19:03,892
Badakizu zergatik?

294
00:19:04,726 --> 00:19:06,811
Ni bezalakoak existitzen direlako.

295
00:19:06,812 --> 00:19:08,730
{\an8}STATUS QUOAREN AURKA
ERREBELDEA

296
00:19:10,315 --> 00:19:12,733
Eta ez zara arrotza sentitzen?

297
00:19:12,734 --> 00:19:13,735
Ez izan zakarra.

298
00:19:14,653 --> 00:19:17,488
{\an8}Zuzen edo oker dagoenari buruz
bakoitzak bere ideia du.

299
00:19:17,489 --> 00:19:21,075
{\an8}Idealak eduki behar dituzu
eta zeure buruaz kontziente izan.

300
00:19:21,076 --> 00:19:24,328
Eta zureak zein diren jakin behar duzu.

301
00:19:24,329 --> 00:19:27,832
- A bai?
- Bai, eta ondoeza horren iturria aurkitu.

302
00:19:27,833 --> 00:19:31,920
{\an8}Zeure buruarekin adiskidetu arte,
ezingo duzu besteekin ondo egon.

303
00:19:34,131 --> 00:19:35,132
{\an8}Kaito.

304
00:19:35,674 --> 00:19:37,925
Zer gertatu zaizu joan zinenetik?

305
00:19:37,926 --> 00:19:40,179
Nahikoa lasaiago bihurtzeko.

306
00:19:40,679 --> 00:19:41,680
APALTASUN EZA

307
00:19:42,222 --> 00:19:43,765
Bueno, ondo segi, bale?

308
00:19:44,266 --> 00:19:46,852
Orain esatea oso aproposa ez izan arren.

309
00:19:47,936 --> 00:19:49,145
Kaito.

310
00:19:49,146 --> 00:19:50,355
Itzuli laster, bale?

311
00:19:50,981 --> 00:19:52,106
Bai.

312
00:19:52,107 --> 00:19:54,443
Zigilua itzultzeko berriz sartuko naiz.

313
00:19:55,068 --> 00:19:57,029
Baina horrela ez!

314
00:19:59,948 --> 00:20:02,242
<i>Egiten dudana egiten dut</i>

315
00:20:02,868 --> 00:20:05,287
<i>ez dudalako anaia bezala amaitu nahi?</i>

316
00:20:06,997 --> 00:20:08,415
<i>Ez.</i>

317
00:20:09,041 --> 00:20:13,170
<i>Ez nuen ulertzen
zergatik zioten hain gorroto handia.</i>

318
00:20:13,879 --> 00:20:15,672
<i>Beldurra nuen.</i>

319
00:20:16,548 --> 00:20:20,593
<i>Eta besteei jarraitzean
gaizki sentitzen nintzenean,</i>

320
00:20:20,594 --> 00:20:24,430
<i>nire asmoa ez zen aurre egitea
edo besteen alde justizia egitea</i>

321
00:20:24,431 --> 00:20:27,184
<i>kritikatzen hasten zirenean.</i>

322
00:20:28,018 --> 00:20:31,188
<i>Ez nuen ulertzen
nolatan gorroto zuten jendea.</i>

323
00:20:31,855 --> 00:20:34,774
<i>Seinalatu egiten dutenak
eta seinalatuak daude.</i>

324
00:20:34,775 --> 00:20:36,610
<i>Orain ez nau inork seinalatzen.</i>

325
00:20:37,319 --> 00:20:40,404
<i>Baina hori edozein unetan alda daiteke.</i>

326
00:20:40,405 --> 00:20:42,156
<i>Zaila zitzaidan ulertzea</i>

327
00:20:42,157 --> 00:20:45,452
<i>hainbeste maltzurkeria
izaki bakar baten aurka zuzenduta egotea.</i>

328
00:20:46,161 --> 00:20:51,123
<i>Uste nuen akatsen bat eginez gero
maltzurkeria horren itu bihurtzea nuela.</i>

329
00:20:51,124 --> 00:20:54,670
Zu mutil ona zara, Minato,
zure anaia ez bezala.

330
00:20:55,212 --> 00:20:58,715
<i>Eta desberdina banintz?</i>

331
00:21:00,050 --> 00:21:01,509
<i>Kaito.</i>

332
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:04,263
<i>Ez naiz zuk uste bezain ona.</i>

333
00:21:05,305 --> 00:21:09,518
<i>Ez naiz musu-truk besteez arduratzen.
Ez naiz jatorra musu-truk.</i>

334
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:14,648
<i>Bakea mantentzen dut
ez dudalako tentsioa jasaten.</i>

335
00:21:15,315 --> 00:21:17,817
<i>Besteengana jotzen dut</i>

336
00:21:17,818 --> 00:21:22,239
<i>beldur naizelako jomuga ni banintz,
inork ez ninduela lagunduko.</i>

337
00:21:23,699 --> 00:21:25,659
<i>Ezin diot inori ezetz esan</i>

338
00:21:26,326 --> 00:21:30,497
<i>haien oinetan jartzen naizelako.</i>

339
00:21:31,665 --> 00:21:34,042
<i>Hori ez da jatorra izatea.</i>

340
00:21:35,043 --> 00:21:38,922
<i>Ahula naiz
eta bakarrik egoteak beldurra ematen dit.</i>

341
00:21:40,090 --> 00:21:44,845
<i>Ez naiz gai izan norbaitekin
benetan fidatzeko eta bihotza irekitzeko.</i>

342
00:21:45,595 --> 00:21:49,766
<i>Ez familiarekin, ez lagunekin. Inorekin.</i>

343
00:21:50,642 --> 00:21:53,811
Munduaren erdigunea izateko
baino ez duzu egiten.

344
00:21:53,812 --> 00:21:55,856
Zure beharrean egon daitezen.

345
00:21:57,441 --> 00:21:58,859
<i>Eta oroipen hori?</i>

346
00:21:59,651 --> 00:22:03,238
<i>Zertaz ari zen banekiela uste arren,
orain bai ulertu dudala.</i>

347
00:22:04,823 --> 00:22:07,075
<i>Ezin dut honela jarraitu.</i>

348
00:22:07,909 --> 00:22:11,038
<i>Irekitzen ari banintz bezala
jokatzen dut, baina ez.</i>

349
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:13,206
<i>Momokari min ematen diot.</i>

350
00:22:14,416 --> 00:22:17,252
<i>Nire probetxurako
erabiltzen ari naiz jendea.</i>

351
00:22:18,754 --> 00:22:20,172
<i>Ezin dut</i>

352
00:22:21,173 --> 00:22:23,091
<i>Momokarekin horrela jarraitu.</i>

353
00:23:50,929 --> 00:23:55,934
Azpitituluak: Loinaz C. A.

